{"overview":"همرفیق نام یک مجموعه شبکه نمایش خانگی با اجرا و کارگردانی شهاب حسینی است که از ۲۰ آذر ۱۳۹۹ با تهیه کنندگی حسن خدادادی شروع به پخش کرد. در هر قسمت از این برنامه مهمانی که دعوت شده‌است می‌تواند یک نفر را به عنوان همرفیق معرفی کند تا در برنامه حضور داشته باشد. فصل اول این برنامه ۳۱ قسمت دارد","tagline":"","overview_en":"Hamrefigh is a series of Home video performed and directed by Shahab Hosseini, which started broadcasting on December 10, 2020, produced by Hassan Khodadadi. In each episode of the program, the invited guest can introduce a person as a friend to be present in the program.","tagline_en":"","runtime":90,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":31,"y":2020,"poster":"/zgsEpyGX4eLcxb1pOmKxSegmEd3.jpg"}],"episodes":31,"crew":["شهاب حسینی"],"crew_en":["Shahab Hosseini"],"countries":["IR"],"cast":[{"name":"شهاب حسینی","role":"Presenter","photo":"/6N567bATJxvhqNOIvdlkkyfpRw7.jpg","en":"Shahab Hosseini"},{"name":"Houman Seyyedi","role":"","photo":"/5v4qmV7LNU1whZcl8qXAWD0dpJR.jpg"},{"name":"نوید محمدزاده","role":"","photo":"/jQR1a4NH6dYPzCrrS22pJAMh8Ww.jpg","en":"Navid Mohammadzadeh"},{"name":"مهدی سلطانی","role":"","photo":"/qyb7zQfVP95Q41k3YDrbBlm9DdZ.jpg","en":"Mehdi Soltani"},{"name":"علی نصیریان","role":"","photo":"/pw4gz3P99lLC8LLYk5lSjJvVoI.jpg","en":"Ali Nasirian"},{"name":"Hootan Shakiba","role":"","photo":"/AijxaDo3kKa6ruiETHAI1MlOWdn.jpg"},{"name":"Mohammadreza Golzar","role":"","photo":"/yxZJ3G8sZAfVO4aU2Z1QwIATGaD.jpg","en":"Mohammad Reza Golzar"},{"name":"سام درخشانی","role":"","photo":"/nvnSAWtouZhOAljQlu42MnYuUfh.jpg","en":"Sam Derakhshani"},{"name":"پژمان جمشیدی","role":"","photo":"/kHgTpsLPkjTWcuzPvDHTHy8hWCB.jpg","en":"Pejman Jamshidi"},{"name":"بهرام افشاری","role":"","photo":"/bdOmVeLxkVTrhTNJ6CfiXckoXD8.jpg","en":"Bahram Afshari"},{"name":"پردیس احمدیه","role":"","photo":"/lFsK2mDPJpvlSntb22B9jHHNIhK.jpg","en":"Pardis Ahmadieh"},{"name":"سارا بهرامی","role":"","photo":"/qgavPvuoWFY0BR3Ouiqr7DeY7aG.jpg","